<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);" color="#ff6600">(Attach Instructions for Designating a Beneficiary to template)</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[client]</span>,&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>The Beneficiary Designation Report identifies whether an employee has designated a beneficiary under Insperity's Basic Group Life Insurance policy. It is available to your employees who have the Benefits Reporting role through Web Reporting on Insperity Premier.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>This is report is helpful during open enrollment or throughout the year to remind employees to update their beneficiary when making annual benefits elections or when they experience a qualifying life event such as marriage, divorce or birth of a child.<br><br>You can navigate to this report by selecting Benefits from the Reporting Dashboard on Insperity Premier within the Reporting Center, then selecting Beneficiary Designation report.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">The report includes the following information:&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li><font face="arial">Beneficiary designation (Yes/No)</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employee name, ID and email address</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employee classification status</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employee eligibility status</font></li><li><font face="arial">Signature date (date of latest designation)</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Note: The report lists active employees as of the date it is run. This information <u>does not</u> include beneficiary information for Voluntary Life Insurance (employee-paid).</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>I have attached instructions for employees who need to designate or change their beneficiary. They can call the Contact Center if they have any questions about these changes.<br></font><span style="font-family: arial;"><br>Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>